15. Day Care Centre means any institution established for day care treatment of illness and/or injuries or a medical
setup with a hospital and which has been registered with the local authorities, wherever applicable, and is under the
supervision of a registered and qualified medical practitioner AND must comply with all minimum criterion as under-
- has qualified nursing staff under its employment;
- has qualified medical practitioner/s in charge;
- has a fully equipped operation theatre of its own where surgical procedures are carried out;
- maintains daily records of patients and will make these accessible to the insurance company’s authorized personnel
